  <BODY>
	<FORM METHOD="POST" ACTION="/cgi-bin/News_Delete.cgi">
        <TABLE WIDTH="100%">
        <TR>
          <TD class="MainHeader" align="center"><FONT SIZE=50>Serenity Within</FONT></TD>
        </TR>
        </TABLE><BR><BR>
 	  <INPUT TYPE="HIDDEN" VALUE="-1" NAME="NewsToDelete">
  	
	<BR>
	<CENTER>
	<TABLE class="BodyTable" width="90%" CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 CELPADING=0>
		<TR>
        <TD class="NewsDateRow" width="100%">
                2001-06-10 - 18:57:54 
        </TD>
        <TD class="NewsDateRow" align="right" NOWRAP width="0">
          
        </TD>
</TR>
<TR>
        <TD class="NewsRow" COLSPAN=2>
Hey guys ....I am trying to clean up the roster.  If you are new to the guild and havent gotten a probationary status at least, please send me a tell in game and I will move you from applicant to probationary status.  Sometimes do to the times we all play, the officers do not see everyone online.  For that reason, just let me know and I will be happy to change your guild status on the roster page.

Thanks 

Tiriella<BR><BR><BR>
        Submitted by <span class="NewsSubmitter">Tiriella Chanducoeur</span>
        </TD>
</TR>
<TR height="10">
</TR>
<TR>
        <TD class="NewsDateRow" width="100%">
                2001-04-24 - 00:16:48 
        </TD>
        <TD class="NewsDateRow" align="right" NOWRAP width="0">
          
        </TD>
</TR>
<TR>
        <TD class="NewsRow" COLSPAN=2>
To all new members. Please make a profile, and keep it updated. This also includes old members. Keep you profile updated with trade skills and level etc.<BR><BR><BR>
        Submitted by <span class="NewsSubmitter">Baiddo Thundercaller</span>
        </TD>
</TR>
<TR height="10">
</TR>

	</TABLE>
 	</CENTER>
  	</FORM>
  </BODY>
</HTML>
